  - m_Id: 69784146669568
    m_Localized: "Welcome to <color=#ff1414>Wild Boar Throw</color>!\r\n\r\nReady
      for action? Before we get started, we'll guide you through a brief tutorial
      to help you master the dynamics of the game.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70566166261760
    m_Localized: You will have only <color=#ff1414>3 seconds</color>! Quickly click
      anywhere on the screen to throw the boar as far as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70702837657600
    m_Localized: "You will also have <color=#ff1414>3 seconds</color>! Carefully
      adjust your launch angle. The closer you are to 45\xB0, the better your shot
      will be!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83737794965504
    m_Localized: "Now select \nan angle !"
